WEBVTT

00:00.220 --> 00:02.030
GTA VI finally dropped.

00:02.450 --> 00:03.830
Anthropic went public.

00:04.300 --> 00:06.330
Jensen Huang got back to Nvidia.

00:06.930 --> 00:08.320
Kit still hasn’t texted back.

00:08.770 --> 00:09.830
Twenty-three messages.

00:09.990 --> 00:10.960
Two blue ticks.

00:11.430 --> 00:13.550
When you’re out, will you come back?

00:14.320 --> 00:16.270
In Six Flights, you can ask the group.

00:16.610 --> 00:18.350
Or go down one flight and knock.

00:18.440 --> 00:19.380
[three knocks]

00:20.100 --> 00:22.560
All he says is, “Friday, maybe.”

00:23.520 --> 00:24.550
People still matter.

00:25.140 --> 00:26.260
Someone had to knock.

00:26.940 --> 00:29.860
We built our choice in Professor David Lee’s class,

00:30.210 --> 00:31.830
with Samantha as our tutor.

00:32.950 --> 00:34.310
Who’s a leader in your life?

00:34.950 --> 00:36.000
Look in the mirror.
